  unitName: Magician Lily
  unitId: 60041
  unitNumber: 66
  description: A sorceress from the ruined Bariura Empire. Her sorcery was one of
    the various skills studied in Bariura. It was originally an art used to read
    fortunes using astronomy and calendars, but she set her own skills apart by emphasizing
    her magical abilities. Her technique effectively combined cosmic forces with
    magic. As her path differed from those who aiming to remain as sorcerers, she
    came to be called a Magician instead.
  summonDesc: You're worried about me?<br>What a child...<br>But you sure are positive.
  fusionDesc: Fusion, huh... It's not so bad.<br>Just a bit troublesome is all.
  evoDesc: Oh, seems I've changed.<br>Whatever, doesn't matter to me.
